+// The updater's parts in a real window (docs/features/updates.md), against a
+// fake updater: the sidebar's "New Stedding Version Available" (Up3), the
+// command bar's rows (Up7), the About page (Up5, Up6), and the thank-you
+// pages after an update and after the install (Up9, Up10). Sparkle itself is
+// tried end to end on a signed build (docs/HANDOFF.md, the updater's n-1
+// check).
